    "alt_text": "Agent and model claims first pass through the prior course's authenticated evidence admission and a protected evidence store. Evidence health checks route incomplete data to UNKNOWN. Complete evidence is partitioned by tenant, subject, case, and a 15-minute event-time window. Deterministic features feed versioned rule, Sigma, statistical, graph, or model detectors that produce evidence-linked hypotheses, not verdicts. An authorized analyst dispositions a hypothesis, after which a separate policy authorizes one bounded response. An executor performs it and an independent verifier records the effect."
